{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033947_82dd1985","chunk_index":21,"job_id":"mwjob_6ea88e6715579409992c43ee","precondition_digest":"968aabd6184f764b8be1b297092e19b0d5f45b861c3a384214982b8cdb9452d9","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v7","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_821ddd4ec4423824","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_47144bb8ad86d32f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1ce08f07f41bcedd","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0685b59028fb9fc4"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033947_82dd1985","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_821ddd4ec4423824\n章节编号=14.1\n章节标题=避孕的规定与方法","quote_sha256":"7e8d841e279926206dae851291773fe2e4728f3900a609b7b245f7a82ef5b139","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","span_id":"span_sel_141"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"方案编号：MW-III-AEA61047-DRAFT\n方案版本：草案\n研究题目：合成试验药A用于治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的III期临床研究\n试验药物：合成试验药A\n适应症：成人中重度斑块状银屑病\n研究分期：III期\n开发区域：中国","quote_sha256":"dbc98b94eb58efcd249884ce6b24cc457357e1ecf225c8acaabdea7532081a4d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"25de1577631d408629fd83338122249e7d0333f30cafbcf4445c1c9991fc6aee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_exclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。","quote_sha256":"4b72f3388e7586f2bc754d65df1ff638f98aed04e4f3067823942002abba8ed1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_dosing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_periods"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_141","span_identity","span_inclusion","span_exclusion","span_intervention","span_dosing","span_periods"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"避孕的规定与方法","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本节说明本研究对有生育潜能受试者的避孕管理要求。研究纳入年龄≥18岁的成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，妊娠或哺乳期女性不可入组，因此需对有生育潜能的受试者进行妊娠风险管理。结合合成试验药A 100 mg每日一次口服、双盲治疗16周并设4周安全性随访期的安排，避孕措施的持续使用时间应与给药暴露和随访阶段相衔接。本节应覆盖可接受与不可接受的避孕方法及其使用要求、避孕措施依从性评价、疑似妊娠或月经异常情况下的妊娠检测安排，以及男性受试者对其女性伴侣的避孕告知要求，以减少研究期间发生妊娠的风险。","rationale":"支持本节正文的项目事实：研究人群为年龄≥18岁成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，妊娠或哺乳期女性为排除人群；试验药A为100 mg每日一次口服，第1天至第16周双盲治疗，另设4周安全性随访期。需医学作者核对并补充：可接受与不可接受避孕方法清单、避孕措施持续的确切时限、妊娠检测频率与异常处理、男性受试者相关避孕要求及避孕依从性评价方式。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（避孕的规定与方法），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_821ddd4ec4423824","section_number":"14.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033947_82dd1985","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_47144bb8ad86d32f\n章节编号=14.2\n章节标题=研究量表和评价工具","quote_sha256":"e6fcf5def50668c35d2e746ca20f45603063284b72992773aa4776d3a10c8548","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","span_id":"span_sel_142"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"9ebc192fbc05715cf7f717f7f5899cd368f8790a1c880b7a2bff3665ad9ac302","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_key_sec"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_other_sec"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_142","span_inclusion","span_visits","span_primary","span_key_sec","span_other_sec"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"研究量表和评价工具","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本节列明本研究使用的评价量表及其评价时点。研究采用PASI、sPGA和DLQI量表，其中PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价，筛选期及基线时的PASI、sPGA评分与受累体表面积还用于入选标准判定，要求PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3。主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例；关键次要终点包括第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例和第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例；其他次要终点包括第16周PASI评分较基线的变化和第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化，其中DLQI用于评价皮肤病相关生活质量。本节说明各量表在筛选、基线和治疗期访视中的使用方式及评分资料采集要求。","rationale":"支持本节正文的项目事实：PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周评价，筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3用于入选判定；主要终点为第16周PASI 75应答率，关键次要终点为第16周sPGA 0或1且改善≥2级与PASI 90应答率，其他次要终点为第16周PASI评分和DLQI评分较基线变化。需医学作者核对并补充：量表版本、语言版本、授权状态及评分者资质与培训要求。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_47144bb8ad86d32f","section_number":"14.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033947_82dd1985","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1ce08f07f41bcedd\n章节编号=14.3\n章节标题=实验室检查项目","quote_sha256":"9da2bd501e647843dce0ecb4447ac6532fd5f849a98366621cf5f6e46e38bfe7","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","span_id":"span_sel_143"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_visits"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_143","span_safety","span_periods","span_visits"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"实验室检查项目","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本节说明本研究安全性评价中实验室检查的构成与实施要求。实验室检查用于支持安全性评价，安全性终点包括实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化，这些评估共同反映合成试验药A治疗期间的安全信号。研究设最长4周的筛选期、16周双盲治疗期和4周安全性随访期，第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访，实验室检查的采样与复查时点应与上述访视安排相衔接。本节应列明本研究开展的实验室检查项目及标本采集、处理和检测安排，说明各项目的临床意义判定要求，并规定对具有临床意义异常结果的复查、随访与记录方式。","rationale":"支持本节正文的项目事实：安全性终点包括实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化；研究包含最长4周筛选期、16周双盲治疗期和4周安全性随访期，治疗期访视在第2、4、8、12、16周，第20周为安全性随访。需医学作者核对并补充：实验室检查具体项目、标本采集与检测单位、各项目采样时点、参考范围与异常值处理规则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1ce08f07f41bcedd","section_number":"14.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033947_82dd1985","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0685b59028fb9fc4\n章节编号=14.4\n章节标题=安全信息报告途径","quote_sha256":"f3ccaebf97fa2c27e93ac6d72907138dde4018884b24bb6eb5e212edc5d12e37","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","span_id":"span_sel_144"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_design"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_144","span_safety","span_periods","span_design"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"安全信息报告途径","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本节说明本研究安全性信息的收集与报告流程。安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，安全性信息的收集覆盖16周双盲治疗期和4周安全性随访期。本节应覆盖不良事件和严重不良事件的定义与记录要求，说明从事件发现、记录、随访到报告的完整路径，包括报告对象、报告时限与递交方式，并纳入妊娠相关信息的报告要求。本节还说明严重不良事件及妊娠相关事件报告后的随访安排与流程衔接要求。","rationale":"支持本节正文的项目事实：安全性终点包括TEAE、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率；安全性信息收集覆盖16周双盲治疗期与4周安全性随访期。需医学作者核对并补充：不良事件与严重不良事件定义、报告对象与时限、妊娠事件上报路径、递交方式及CRF记录要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（安全信息报告途径），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0685b59028fb9fc4","section_number":"14.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:81be3aff4725983f8ccfc35a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e8